      "created_at": "2014-07-03T11:25:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Definitely option three - the Sentinels are one <span class=\"bbcode-i\">hero</span> but multiple hero <span class=\"bbcode-i\">targets</span>. If something affects a <span class=\"bbcode-i\">hero</span> and they're an applicable target (as in your case with Summer), only one of the individual Sentinels receives the effect.</p>\n<p>Mind you, Christopher has already agreed so I think any post after that is pretty moot…but I wanted to say something anyway ;).</p>",
